  "definition": "Provider Participation",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-06-22",
  "historyNote": "#7775, eff 10-8-02; ss by #9768, eff 10-8-10; ss by #10092, eff 3-1-12 (from He-W 549.03); amd by #11124, eff 6-22-16",
